      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN HARMONY (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 400m behind Like A Porsha (23.65) in a Grade 5. Scored at her previous run. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Has winning claims on her best figures. ZIPPING ZVEREV (2) turned in a solid run last start over 527m at Gunnedah finishing 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (30.91). Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. THRILL SEEKER (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing eighth (23.34) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Expected to give a good account. REBEL FLARE (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
